{"id": "23", "title": "コールドプレス 100%オーガニックオレンジ", "categories": ["飲料", "beverages"], "description": "熱を加えずに摩擦を最小限に抑えて圧搾したコールドプレスジュース。オレンジが持つビタミンCや酵素をそのまま補給でき、爽やかでジューシーです。", "priceInfo": {"currencyCode": "JPY", "price": 680.0, "originalPrice": 680.0}, "images": [{"uri": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1613478223719-2ab802602423?w=600&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80"}], "rating": {"averageRating": 4.7, "ratingCount": 30}, "availability": "IN_STOCK", "attributes": [{"key": "origin", "value": {"text": ["国産"]}}, {"key": "unit", "value": {"text": ["1本（250ml）"]}}, {"key": "nutrition_calories", "value": {"text": ["110 kcal"]}}, {"key": "nutrition_protein", "value": {"text": ["1.8 g"]}}, {"key": "nutrition_fat", "value": {"text": ["0.2 g"]}}, {"key": "nutrition_carbs", "value": {"text": ["25.2 g"]}}]}
{"id": "24", "title": "新潟県魚沼産 特選有機コシヒカリ", "categories": ["調味料", "pantry"], "description": "豪雪地帯である魚沼の冷たい雪解け水で育まれた特撰のコシヒカリ。ふっくらとモチモチした食感で、強い甘みとツヤが格別なお米です。", "priceInfo": {"currencyCode": "JPY", "price": 3980.0, "originalPrice": 3980.0}, "images": [{"uri": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611143669185-af224c5e3252?w=600&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80"}], "rating": {"averageRating": 5.0, "ratingCount": 93}, "availability": "IN_STOCK", "attributes": [{"key": "origin", "value": {"text": ["新潟県産"]}}, {"key": "unit", "value": {"text": ["5kg"]}}, {"key": "nutrition_calories", "value": {"text": ["168 kcal (per 100g cooked)"]}}, {"key": "nutrition_protein", "value": {"text": ["2.5 g"]}}, {"key": "nutrition_fat", "value": {"text": ["0.3 g"]}}, {"key": "nutrition_carbs", "value": {"text": ["37.1 g"]}}]}
{"id": "25", "title": "伝統木桶仕込み 天然醸造特選醤油", "categories": ["調味料", "pantry"], "description": "香川県小豆島で、100年以上使われている木桶の中で二夏じっくり熟成させた天然醸造の生醤油。驚くほどまろやかでコクがあり、お刺身や焼き魚に最適です。", "priceInfo": {"currencyCode": "JPY", "price": 850.0, "originalPrice": 850.0}, "images": [{"uri": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1579871494447-9811cf80d66c?w=600&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80"}], "rating": {"averageRating": 4.9, "ratingCount": 38}, "availability": "IN_STOCK", "attributes": [{"key": "origin", "value": {"text": ["香川県産"]}}, {"key": "unit", "value": {"text": ["1本（360ml）"]}}, {"key": "nutrition_calories", "value": {"text": ["13 kcal (per 15ml)"]}}, {"key": "nutrition_protein", "value": {"text": ["1.5 g"]}}, {"key": "nutrition_fat", "value": {"text": ["0.0 g"]}}, {"key": "nutrition_carbs", "value": {"text": ["1.2 g"]}}]}
{"id": "26", "title": "シチリア島直輸入 エキストラバージンオリーブオイル", "categories": ["調味料", "pantry"], "description": "シチリア島で手摘み収穫後すぐに冷温圧搾された、新鮮でフルーティーなオリーブオイル。青リンゴやハーブを思わせる爽やかな香りとスパイシーな余韻が際立ちます。", "priceInfo": {"currencyCode": "JPY", "price": 2480.0, "originalPrice": 2480.0}, "images": [{"uri": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1474979266404-7eaacbcd87c5?w=600&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80"}], "rating": {"averageRating": 4.8, "ratingCount": 27}, "availability": "IN_STOCK", "attributes": [{"key": "origin", "value": {"text": ["イタリア・シチリア島産"]}}, {"key": "unit", "value": {"text": ["1本（500ml）"]}}, {"key": "nutrition_calories", "value": {"text": ["120 kcal (per 14g)"]}}, {"key": "nutrition_protein", "value": {"text": ["0.0 g"]}}, {"key": "nutrition_fat", "value": {"text": ["14.0 g"]}}, {"key": "nutrition_carbs", "value": {"text": ["0.0 g"]}}]}
{"id": "27", "title": "信州・八ヶ岳 アカシア極上純粋蜂蜜", "categories": ["調味料", "pantry"], "description": "八ヶ岳の豊かな自然の中で育つアカシアの花から集められた、無添加・非加熱の純粋はちみつ。上品でクセのない甘みと透明感は、ヨーグルトや紅茶にピッタリです。", "priceInfo": {"currencyCode": "JPY", "price": 1890.0, "originalPrice": 1890.0}, "images": [{"uri": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1448062885262-aa6670248b0e?w=600&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80"}], "rating": {"averageRating": 4.9, "ratingCount": 33}, "availability": "IN_STOCK", "attributes": [{"key": "origin", "value": {"text": ["長野県産"]}}, {"key": "unit", "value": {"text": ["1本（250g）"]}}, {"key": "nutrition_calories", "value": {"text": ["294 kcal (per 100g)"]}}, {"key": "nutrition_protein", "value": {"text": ["0.2 g"]}}, {"key": "nutrition_fat", "value": {"text": ["0.0 g"]}}, {"key": "nutrition_carbs", "value": {"text": ["79.7 g"]}}]}
